==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.67 seconds<sup>20f~50f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.67 seconds<sup>20f~50f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)|Sanosuke Sagara]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam your Normal Cats and you win.

